    {
      "id": "p0102-b010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "A snake-haired enemy named Parsnik appears in the ruins during Underta/e's secret Hard Mode. In the English version, a battle option titled \"Snack\" becomes available during this encounter. Occasionally, Parsnik mishears this \"snack\" as \"snake\", then aggressively offers \"tasty snakes\" to the player.",
        "raw": "A snake-haired enemy named Parsnik appears in the ruins during Underta/e's\nsecret Hard Mode. In the English version, a battle option titled \"Snack\"\nbecomes available during this encounter. Occasionally, Parsnik mishears this\n\"snack\" as \"snake\", then aggressively offers \"tasty snakes\" to the player.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.28667569,
          0.62229286,
          0.88339947,
          0.69002857
